{"created": "2023-10-02T20:42:36.516406+00:00", "modified": "2023-10-03T02:26:59.722365+00:00", "id": 8399738, "conceptrecid": "7762057", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7762057", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "metadata": {"title": "Public Data files for MassFormer", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "publication_date": "2023-10-02", "description": "<p>Public data files&nbsp;for experiments&nbsp;in <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.04824\">MassFormer</a>. See the <a href=\"https://github.com/roestlab/massformer\">Github repository</a>&nbsp;for instructions on how to use this data.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Raw Data:</strong></p>\n\n<p>casmi_2016.tgz - <a href=\"http://www.casmi-contest.org/2016/\">Critical Assessment of Small Molecule Identification 2016</a>, used for model evaluation.</p>\n\n<p>casmi_2022.tgz - <a href=\"https://fiehnlab.ucdavis.edu/casmi/casmi-2022-results\">Critical Assessment of Small Molecule Identification 2022</a>, used for model evaluation.</p>\n\n<p>mb_na_msms.msp.gz - <a href=\"https://mona.fiehnlab.ucdavis.edu/downloads\">MassBank of North America</a> export of LC-MS/MS spectra, used for model evaluation.</p>\n\n<p>cid_smiles.tsv.gz - Mapping of CID to SMILES strings, obtained from <a href=\"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/\">PubChem</a>.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Processed Data:</strong></p>\n\n<p>proc_casmi_2016.tgz - Processed spectrum and molecule data for the CASMI 2016 benchmark.</p>\n\n<p>proc_casmi_2022.tgz - Processed spectrum and molecule data for the CASMI 2022&nbsp;benchmark.</p>\n\n<p>proc_nist20_outlier.tgz - Processed spectrum and molecule data for the NIST20 Outlier&nbsp;benchmark (formerly called pseudo-CASMI).</p>\n\n<p>proc_demo.tgz - Processed spectrum and molecule data for the demo (refer to code repository for more information).</p>\n\n<p>cfm.tgz - Predicted spectra for the <a href=\"https://cfmid.wishartlab.com/\">Competitive Fragmentation Modelling (CFM)</a> baseline.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Model Checkpoints:</strong></p>\n\n<p>demo.pkl - Checkpoint of a MassFormer model trained on MoNA data, for the purposes of running the demo.</p>\n\n<p>checkpoint_best_pcqm4mv2.pt - Checkpoint of a Graphormer model pretrained on the PCQM4M dataset, used for initialization of some MassFormer models. Copied from&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ml2md.blob.core.windows.net/graphormer-ckpts/checkpoint_best_pcqm4mv2.pt\">this url</a>. Please refer to the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Graphormer\">Graphormer repository</a>&nbsp;for more information.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Adamo Young", "affiliation": "University of Toronto", "orcid": "0000-0001-5620-6241"}, {"name": "Bo Wang", "affiliation": "University of Toronto", "orcid": "0000-0002-9620-3413"}, {"name": "Hannes R\u00f6st", "affiliation": "University of Toronto", "orcid": "0000-0003-0990-7488"}], "keywords": ["mass spectrometry", "metabolomics", "deep learning", "transformers"], "version": "0.3.2", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 5, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7762057"}}]}}, "title": "Public Data files for MassFormer", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8399738", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8399738", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8399738?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8399738", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8399738/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7762057", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7762057", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7762057", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7762057", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8399738/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence"